WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.309 --> 00:00:03.328
- Make sure that you know what you want

00:00:03.328 --> 00:00:04.783
and go for it.

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:06.683
I'm totally like a confident person.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:08.186
I'll stand up to everybody.

00:00:08.186 --> 00:00:10.708
I love to express myself.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:12.957
I always just focus on the positive side.

00:00:12.957 --> 00:00:15.279
♫ When you're gone

00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:19.545
♫ The pieces of my heart are missing you

00:00:19.545 --> 00:00:22.403
♫ When you're gone

00:00:22.403 --> 00:00:23.236
- What's up, Believe Nation?

00:00:23.236 --> 00:00:24.069
It's Evan.

00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:25.391
My one word is 'believe',

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:26.801
and I believe that you have

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.550
the ability to do something special

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.009
that can change the planet.

00:00:30.009 --> 00:00:31.291
So to help you on your journey today

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:32.669
we're going to learn from the Canadian

00:00:32.669 --> 00:00:34.736
singer-songwriter, Avril Lavigne,

00:00:34.736 --> 00:00:37.675
and my take on her top
ten rules for success.

00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:39.580
Rule number nine is my personal favorite

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:43.747
and I'd love to know which
one you guys like the best.

00:00:45.415 --> 00:00:47.915
(theme music)

00:00:55.573 --> 00:00:56.733
- [Interviewer] If you could go back,

00:00:56.733 --> 00:00:57.848
like in a time machine,

00:00:57.848 --> 00:01:00.084
and speak to you when
you were 15, you know,

00:01:00.084 --> 00:01:01.948
what sort of advice
would you give yourself,

00:01:01.948 --> 00:01:03.571
knowing what you know now?

00:01:03.571 --> 00:01:05.455
- Pretty much the same
advice that I do know,

00:01:05.455 --> 00:01:09.018
which is make sure that
you know what you want

00:01:09.018 --> 00:01:10.518
and go for it, and

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:15.947
don't let anyone change your mind.

00:01:17.046 --> 00:01:18.784
I was always very focused,

00:01:18.784 --> 00:01:20.396
and I've always been the type of person

00:01:20.396 --> 00:01:22.313
that listens to my gut,

00:01:24.051 --> 00:01:26.331
and I think it's important to do that,

00:01:26.331 --> 00:01:28.604
to go with your instincts.

00:01:28.604 --> 00:01:30.260
I would say that to myself.

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:32.350
And I definitely did do that.

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:34.686
Pretty much everyone that's
working with me gets, like,

00:01:34.686 --> 00:01:38.348
what I'm into, and what I like, and stuff,

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:40.986
but if there ever is a situation,

00:01:40.986 --> 00:01:42.819
then I'm totally, like,
a confident person.

00:01:42.819 --> 00:01:46.111
I'll stand up to everybody
and tell them, like,

00:01:46.111 --> 00:01:47.893
"No, I really believe this.

00:01:47.893 --> 00:01:50.810
"This is what my gut's telling me."

00:01:55.768 --> 00:01:57.007
If there's something that's bugging me,

00:01:57.007 --> 00:01:58.754
like I'll totally speak up to it.

00:01:58.754 --> 00:02:00.400
Like, speak up about it.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:03.951
I'm not shy and I'm not going to let ...

00:02:03.951 --> 00:02:05.641
It's too risky to let, you know--

00:02:05.641 --> 00:02:06.677
This is my life.

00:02:06.677 --> 00:02:08.498
I don't want to, like, mess up my career

00:02:08.498 --> 00:02:11.498
and so I need to speak up and, like,

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.551
tell people what I think.

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:17.501
On Under My Skin I kind
of just went right off

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:20.006
of my tour into writing the record.

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:22.000
And it was done in six months.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.824
I knew how I wanted it to sound,

00:02:23.824 --> 00:02:25.935
and how I wanted it to come across.

00:02:25.935 --> 00:02:27.416
So, I had to share my vision.

00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:28.783
♫ Give up the grudge

00:02:28.783 --> 00:02:30.447
♫ (bleep) mouth

00:02:30.447 --> 00:02:31.770
♫ Why you got to judge

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:34.463
♫ Everybody but yourself

00:02:34.463 --> 00:02:38.602
I feel like this record
is more emotional for me,

00:02:38.602 --> 00:02:41.842
you know, it's just, it's deeper, and

00:02:41.842 --> 00:02:44.833
I just feel like I was
able to express myself

00:02:44.833 --> 00:02:46.322
on a different level.

00:02:46.322 --> 00:02:48.808
(Crowd sings "Girlfriend")

00:02:48.808 --> 00:02:50.173
(shouts)

00:02:50.173 --> 00:02:51.788
(shouts)

00:02:51.788 --> 00:02:52.621
Sink in.

00:02:57.023 --> 00:02:59.807
I've always been a really carefree spirit.

00:02:59.807 --> 00:03:01.753
I've always wanted to just have fun.

00:03:01.753 --> 00:03:05.503
And so, I feel like I
love to express myself,

00:03:06.855 --> 00:03:09.014
and to be emotional, and ...

00:03:09.014 --> 00:03:12.843
And I feel like, on camera,
and stuff like that,

00:03:12.843 --> 00:03:15.047
I feel like that's what I do,

00:03:15.047 --> 00:03:18.689
and I was born with wanting to do this.

00:03:18.689 --> 00:03:21.061
I guess the only thing is,
when I was younger, you know,

00:03:21.061 --> 00:03:24.223
having to deal with, "Why
don't people like me?"

00:03:24.223 --> 00:03:26.036
You know, I didn't do anything to them.

00:03:26.036 --> 00:03:27.570
That would have been the struggle,

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.679
I guess, if anything.

00:03:29.679 --> 00:03:32.497
But that is just how it is.

00:03:32.497 --> 00:03:34.244
And there's nothing you can do about it.

00:03:34.244 --> 00:03:38.486
So I always just focus
on the positive side,

00:03:38.486 --> 00:03:42.069
and the positive side
is a very large side.

00:03:43.464 --> 00:03:44.297
I'm really focused.

00:03:44.297 --> 00:03:46.649
I'm here, I'm in Hollywood,
because I have a job.

00:03:46.649 --> 00:03:48.730
I'm a songwriter, I'm a
singer, I'm a performer.

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.076
I spend the majority of my time

00:03:50.076 --> 00:03:52.116
on the road, touring.

00:03:52.116 --> 00:03:53.089
And you know something?

00:03:53.089 --> 00:03:54.009
That was my dream.

00:03:54.009 --> 00:03:55.064
I worked really hard for it.

00:03:55.064 --> 00:03:56.527
So you know, I've just--

00:03:56.527 --> 00:03:59.523
I'm really dedicated to my career, and

00:03:59.523 --> 00:04:03.682
also expanding into other
things, like Abbey Dawn.

00:04:03.682 --> 00:04:05.135
Yeah, I have passion for music,

00:04:05.135 --> 00:04:08.572
and now my music career has blown up,

00:04:08.572 --> 00:04:09.649
it's done really well.

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:11.569
And now I have, like, great opportunities,

00:04:11.569 --> 00:04:14.069
I'm in a really situation,
I'm very thankful.

00:04:14.069 --> 00:04:16.304
And I want to do other
things, too, you know.

00:04:16.304 --> 00:04:19.865
I'm looking for a lead role
in a movie, and that'll be,

00:04:19.865 --> 00:04:20.899
you know, that'll be a challenge,

00:04:20.899 --> 00:04:21.743
which is what I like.

00:04:21.743 --> 00:04:23.566
And I want to do other things, you know,

00:04:23.566 --> 00:04:27.030
The clothing line, that's like, very me.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.064
Like, my style.

00:04:28.064 --> 00:04:30.673
Like, do other things,
and create, like ...

00:04:30.673 --> 00:04:33.568
I just, I want to do a million things.

00:04:33.568 --> 00:04:37.401
I think, like for me,
I'm a young free spirit,

00:04:39.158 --> 00:04:41.146
like I work hard, but I also like

00:04:41.146 --> 00:04:43.131
to not take things too seriously,

00:04:43.131 --> 00:04:46.112
and really, like, coming back to the song,

00:04:46.112 --> 00:04:47.995
it's just about, like, you know,

00:04:47.995 --> 00:04:49.897
it doesn't matter what age you are.

00:04:49.897 --> 00:04:53.454
And, you know, it's all about,
it's your state of mind.

00:04:53.454 --> 00:04:56.076
So I think, you know, a lot of times

00:04:56.076 --> 00:04:58.610
it's an approach, it's one thing.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.348
And yeah, I think it's positive.

00:05:00.348 --> 00:05:03.172
I always tweet my fans, and ask them,

00:05:03.172 --> 00:05:05.514
"Hey, like what song do you
guys like on the record?

00:05:05.514 --> 00:05:07.419
"And how do you feel about

00:05:07.419 --> 00:05:08.829
"these two songs being the single?"

00:05:08.829 --> 00:05:10.533
And I get to read their feedback,

00:05:10.533 --> 00:05:12.449
and be connected with
the fans through Twitter,

00:05:12.449 --> 00:05:14.063
and it's really cool.

00:05:14.063 --> 00:05:15.813
'Cause I can have that
personal relationship,

00:05:15.813 --> 00:05:17.684
and we can kind of communicate that way.

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:19.713
And it's nice for me.

00:05:19.713 --> 00:05:21.379
I just think it's really important

00:05:21.379 --> 00:05:23.614
to listen to yourself, and to be yourself,

00:05:23.614 --> 00:05:25.982
and believe in yourself,
and whatever it is,

00:05:25.982 --> 00:05:27.920
anything that you're trying to do.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.628
- Absolutely, that applies
to life in general.

00:05:29.628 --> 00:05:31.450
- Yeah, in general, you got to be happy.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.283
Life's short. (crowd cheers, applauds)

00:05:32.283 --> 00:05:33.816
- Good advice from Avril Lavigne.

00:05:33.816 --> 00:05:36.053
- I have to make music for myself.

00:05:36.053 --> 00:05:38.297
And I have to go with,

00:05:38.297 --> 00:05:40.975
in the direction that I'm
feeling, and that I want.

00:05:40.975 --> 00:05:43.511
Because I, you know I can't do something

00:05:43.511 --> 00:05:46.200
that I don't want to do,
and then not be happy.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.455
It's all about being happy.

00:05:47.455 --> 00:05:49.905
And that's always been
my message to my fans,

00:05:49.905 --> 00:05:52.484
is just, "Be who you
are, know who you are,

00:05:52.484 --> 00:05:53.679
"and go after it."

