00:08:50.213 --> 00:08:51.674
- Well, I think because I was so popular

00:08:51.674 --> 00:08:53.051
when I came out, there was a lot of people

00:08:53.051 --> 00:08:54.591
who were like, "Oh, she's fake."

00:08:54.591 --> 00:08:56.963
And, "She's not real."

00:08:56.963 --> 00:08:59.564
And that to me was weird,
because I felt like,

00:08:59.564 --> 00:09:01.105
I am the one who's real.

00:09:01.105 --> 00:09:04.301
If anyone would have told me how to be,

00:09:04.301 --> 00:09:08.605
they would have said,
"Dress nicer. Talk better.

00:09:08.605 --> 00:09:10.549
"Like, don't swear. Like, be ..."

00:09:10.549 --> 00:09:11.382
You know what I mean?

00:09:11.382 --> 00:09:12.353
They would have turned me into

00:09:12.353 --> 00:09:14.801
someone nicer, like, I don't know,

00:09:14.801 --> 00:09:16.312
a Hilary Duff or something.

00:09:16.312 --> 00:09:17.442
I think she--

00:09:17.442 --> 00:09:19.136
I'm not dissing her in any way, but

00:09:19.136 --> 00:09:22.321
someone more like that, I think.

00:09:22.321 --> 00:09:24.245
And I was just very myself,

00:09:24.245 --> 00:09:25.739
and different from everyone.

00:09:25.739 --> 00:09:27.480
And so to hear people say that I was fake,

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.888
I was like, (raspberry) "No I'm not.

00:09:29.888 --> 00:09:31.668
"I'm like the most real thing ever.

00:09:31.668 --> 00:09:33.510
"I'm like myself."

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.745
I've grown in many ways on my new album,

00:09:35.745 --> 00:09:37.069
Goodby Lullaby.

00:09:37.069 --> 00:09:39.179
I wrote half the record by myself,

00:09:39.179 --> 00:09:40.929
I produced two songs.

00:09:41.864 --> 00:09:44.403
I played more instruments on it.

00:09:44.403 --> 00:09:46.602
And whereas I typically, usually just,

00:09:46.602 --> 00:09:48.216
like, co-write all my music,

00:09:48.216 --> 00:09:52.049
this time I pushed myself,
I produced, and ...

00:09:53.701 --> 00:09:57.374
And this is also my fourth world tour.

00:09:57.374 --> 00:09:59.898
So I feel that with every album,

00:09:59.898 --> 00:10:01.927
and with every tour, I'm constantly

00:10:01.927 --> 00:10:04.679
learning more through my experiences.

